research/audit/wave6-topology.proof-contracts.json-6772-          "source_section": "Statement",
research/audit/wave6-topology.proof-contracts.json-6773-          "quote": "Let $n\\ge1$. A subset $C\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n$ is called **convex** here when $$u,v\\in C,\\ t\\in[0,1]\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad(1-t)u+tv\\in C.$$ If $X$ is a topological space and $f,g:X\\to C$ are continuous, where $C$ has the subspace topology from $\\mathbb R^n$, then $$H:X\\times I\\longrightarrow C,\\qquad H(x,t)=(1-t)f(x)+tg(x),$$ is continuous.",
research/audit/wave6-topology.proof-contracts.json-6774-          "uses": [
