research/audit/wave2-impact-audit.json-6281-      "notes": "Material root(s): lem-finite-set-has-max, rem-sup-conventions, thm-compact-implies-the-other-compactness-forms. Root lem-finite-set-has-max: a Remark falsely claimed no published item cites this lemma (117 published items list it in deps). The claim was replaced with durable prose, and Alpha removed a residual consumer claim. The Statement and the induction are unchanged, so all 117 consumers remain licensed by exactly what they cited. Root rem-sup-conventions: a promise that a later page would introduce the extended real line was replaced by a statement of fact, recorded as a forward reference and not a deps edge. The conventions it fixes are unchanged. Root thm-compact-implies-the-other-compactness-forms: a Remark-only Fact was deleted and stated inline; no numbered step used it. Alpha read this consumer’s use of each material root from disk: no fact, numbered step or Statement of this item relies on the text that changed, so its citation remains licensed."
